#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:1
#: d9968bd9c9594fe185b6a539a4938088
msgid "Operations and contribution"
msgstr "Operacion y contribucion"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:3
#: 1a642f21c562424caff4e85cdb64013a
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuracion"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:5
#: e60cbfa6d488471e81ac7d906f8de209
msgid ""
"Keep secrets outside documentation and source control. Use `.env.example` as"
" the public contract and store real values only in the designated local "
"settings surface."
msgstr ""
"Mantenga los secretos fuera de la documentacion y del control de codigo. Use"
" `.env.example` como contrato publico y guarde los valores reales solo en la"
" superficie local designada."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:7
#: d6bf218941db493d8ece047f82248ec9
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "Pruebas"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:9
#: 0e1005f535124867a0d5dcc9436d89a1
msgid ""
"Run the repository checks listed in the quickstart. A passing narrow test "
"does not prove unrelated interfaces or scientific claims."
msgstr ""
"Ejecute las comprobaciones del repositorio indicadas en el inicio rapido. "
"Una prueba acotada superada no demuestra interfaces no relacionadas ni "
"afirmaciones cientificas."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:11
#: 9a1f624fee44457986c303688a4e4bab
msgid "For the local WebMCP gate:"
msgstr "For the local WebMCP gate:"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:19
#: fe8b245ab44c4ee8998d53f4985a358d
msgid ""
"Generated JSON, HTML, Markdown, SARIF, and SHA-bound receipts are written "
"under `output/webmcp-evidence/`. The suite gate loads the twelve repository "
"exports declared in `tools/webmcp-product-matrix.json`, permits only the two"
" shared tool-name repetitions, and requires 144 descriptors, 122 unique "
"names, and 72 journeys. Missing exports remain explicit. Chrome and Edge "
"discovery remain `not_run` until tested in those browsers; the local score "
"must not be presented as browser evidence."
msgstr ""
"Generated JSON, HTML, Markdown, SARIF, and SHA-bound receipts are written "
"under `output/webmcp-evidence/`. The suite gate loads the twelve repository "
"exports declared in `tools/webmcp-product-matrix.json`, permits only the two"
" shared tool-name repetitions, and requires 144 descriptors, 122 unique "
"names, and 72 journeys. Missing exports remain explicit. Chrome and Edge "
"discovery remain `not_run` until tested in those browsers; the local score "
"must not be presented as browser evidence."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:21
#: e5666a3c5e66460cb6090bfa471fa46b
msgid ""
"For a production-runtime smoke check, build and start the Vinext server, "
"then verify both the application page and the versioned manifest endpoint:"
msgstr ""
"For a production-runtime smoke check, build and start the Vinext server, "
"then verify both the application page and the versioned manifest endpoint:"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:32
#: 39cfa522db334d0cb06834bfc6e1c3af
msgid ""
"Both requests must return HTTP 200, `/app` must contain nonblank Scholarium "
"HTML, and the manifest must declare `securedme.webmcp.v1`, twelve tools, and"
" `canonicalStateOwner: algoquest`. The local Node production runner reads "
"configuration from `process.env` only when the Cloudflare runtime module is "
"not available; an absent session secret remains a fail-closed "
"unauthenticated state."
msgstr ""
"Both requests must return HTTP 200, `/app` must contain nonblank Scholarium "
"HTML, and the manifest must declare `securedme.webmcp.v1`, twelve tools, and"
" `canonicalStateOwner: algoquest`. The local Node production runner reads "
"configuration from `process.env` only when the Cloudflare runtime module is "
"not available; an absent session secret remains a fail-closed "
"unauthenticated state."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:38
#: e4eaa57a574f411a96abf2de904c7d5b
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solucion de problemas"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:40
#: ff144dd507b74a55922d44aa1d21f5cc
msgid "Confirm the repository and branch."
msgstr "Confirme el repositorio y la rama."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:41
#: 89b8a740148543efbdc7ae49418d0f2e
msgid "Reproduce with the smallest supported input."
msgstr "Reproduzca con la entrada compatible mas pequena."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:42
#: 65d27f749cd945dea03a54849307500a
msgid "Capture the exact command and error."
msgstr "Registre el comando y el error exactos."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:43
#: fb691510724641c996d3f38295ab485d
msgid "Check the documented runtime and lockfile."
msgstr "Compruebe el runtime documentado y el archivo de bloqueo."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:44
#: 722e2b74015842f0be58875dd1e03e13
msgid "Open an issue with secret-free evidence."
msgstr "Abra una incidencia con evidencia sin secretos."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:46
#: e00f6f92661f4e23b781cc5b65faeadf
msgid "Security and privacy"
msgstr "Seguridad y privacidad"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:48
#: e893941a957e46eaaefa68a3bdeb1d34
msgid ""
"Scholarium organizes and publishes reviewed material; it is not an academic,"
" legal, or taxonomic authority."
msgstr ""
"Scholarium organiza y publica material revisado; no es una autoridad "
"academica, juridica ni taxonomica."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:50
#: d75ad1aaf6394060b3db0a57dc413e67
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Contribuir"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:52
#: 4e18b35b85bc435196c7be3dcecd15b6
msgid ""
"Read `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md`, and the repository "
"license when present. Keep changes bounded and include the checks that "
"justify acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Lea `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md` y la licencia del "
"repositorio cuando existan. Mantenga los cambios acotados e incluya las "
"comprobaciones que justifican su aceptacion."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:54
#: 53c0751c078940649305ff15e6636503
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "Versiones publicadas"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:56
#: 647cba9870ed4f3c8e4280bde61297ff
msgid ""
"The current public documentation describes `pre-alpha` with status `public-"
"pre-alpha`. Consult the repository history and release notes for changes."
msgstr ""
"La documentacion publica actual describe `pre-alpha` con el estado `public-"
"pre-alpha`. Consulte el historial del repositorio y las notas de version "
"para conocer los cambios."
